{
  "_readme": [
    "fpsonar's self-lint configuration: EVERY registered rule enabled, resolution on.",
    "The rule list comes from the linked CLI's 'init-config' output: run it, keep the",
    "rule ids, and give each one 'enabled': true and nothing else. self-lint-gate.sh",
    "does not write this file; it fails naming any registered id that is missing.",
    "Rules are listed with 'enabled' only, so each rule keeps its declared default",
    "severity, and a params block here would silence a rule while still reading as",
    "enabled - the gate rejects one.",
    "The gate thresholds are all -1 (unlimited) on purpose: the CLI's exit code is",
    "then a pure error signal and the gate's verdict is self-lint-gate.sh's own",
    "new-finding count. This file is NOT the shipped default (fpsonar.default.json",
    "keeps resolution off and its own thresholds); it exists only for dogfooding."
  ],
